~C. "The gate has letters."#Incorrect. This does not explain a craft job.
=D. "The gate is locked, which traps the character outside the house and makes the conflict physical."#Correct. This explains how the element affects meaning and conflict.
}

::CW_U02_L03_Q22::[MLA.CW.FIC.01] Which detail is most likely decorative rather than meaningful?{
