}

::CW_U02_L03_Q24::[MLA.CW.FIC.01] What is the strongest revision goal for Lesson 3 writing?{
~A. Add as many objects as possible.#Incorrect. Quantity is not the goal. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
=B. Use one key element intentionally so it adds meaning or style.#Correct. This matches the lesson goal. This answer matches the lesson skill and is supported by the specific creative-writing evidence in the prompt.
~C. Make every sentence explain the theme directly.#Incorrect. Creative writing often lets details imply meaning.
